# Volkswagen Golf Mk7 five-door hatchback, 2012-2019.
#
# 4,255 mm long, 1,799 mm wide, 1,452 mm high, 2,637 mm wheelbase; 1.2-2.0
# petrol and 1.6/2.0 diesel, plus the GTI and R. Facelift in 2017.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volkswagen_Golf_Mk7
#
# Colours: Tornado Red, Reflex Silver, Deep Black and Pure White are period Golf
# colours.
#
# Weight: 300 in total (red 85, silver 85, black 70, white 60).
#
# Speed 210 km/h; comfort 125/370 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 2012-2019 with a road tail to about 2028.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vw-golf-mk7.blend. References:
# citycars/references/vw-golf-mk7/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

